  "description": "WASI Preview 1 implementation for WACS. Successor to the deprecated WACS.WASIp1 package; identical API under the new Wacs.WASI.Preview1 namespace. C# `TypeForwardedTo` cannot bridge a namespace rename, so the deprecated WACS.WASIp1 package is now a metapackage that pulls this assembly in transitively while consumers update their `using Wacs.WASIp1;` lines to `using Wacs.WASI.Preview1;` (one-shot sed in docs/MIGRATION_WASIp1_to_WASI.md).",
